  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tuvalu: contribution to health priorities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity will aim to consolidate 3 areas of support to Tuvalu:
&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Provide health sector budget support to Tuvalu for it to action its National Health Strategy Plan, including the reform of public health legislation and policy.&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Provide funding for Tuvalu public health technical assistance.&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Provide funding for health sector workforce training, including training of nurses in Fiji.&#xa0;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
